            "text": "Lampranthus bicolor, the bicoloured lampranthus, is a species of flowering plant in the family Aizoaceae, native to the southwestern Cape Provinces of South Africa. A spreading succulent reaching {{cvt|30|cm}}, it prefers to grow in sandy areas."
